				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-470957#post-2581811</guid>
				<title>Mod Post - Open</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-470957/scp-2421-j#post-2581811</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 31 Aug 2016 18:17:50 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zyn</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1404533</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Dans890, if you would like help with writing for the site, the correct place to ask for it would be the help forums.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-891087/help:general-advice">General Advice</a> is where you can ask questions about the writing process in general.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-and-brainstorming">Ideas and Brainstorming</a> is where you polish up concepts before you start writing a draft.</p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/c-50864/help:drafts-and-critiques">Drafts and Critiques</a> is where you would ask for reviews on a finished draft that you would like to submit to the mainsite.</p> <p>Also, just a common courtesy note&#8212;it's kind of rude to ask for help on your own work in the discussion page of someone else's article. Please try to avoid doing that!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
