					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This joke is up for review. Come check it out, see if it tickles your fancy.</p> <hr /> <p>While this does have some funny lines, the overall joke seemed to&#8230; basic, for me, on this reread. I can appreciate where it's going, but it does so without any subtlety. It's just &quot;here is a site trend presented in an amusing fashion. Here are some amusning lines in it about said trend&quot;. Returning to this a year later after I initially liked it, it doesn't do anything for me now.</p> 
				 	]]>
